h loci independently have Chisda using the great-teacher formula.","evidence":[{"reference":"Sukkah 33b:2","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Sukkah_33b.2"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Sukkah 35b:12","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Sukkah_35b.12"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Sukkah 35b:13","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Sukkah_35b.13"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]}],"inlineHebrew":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7,9,10],"holds":[{"raw":"לא ידעתי מנ\"ל דחסא רבו","reason":"Tosafot names Chasa his teacher. Heilprin questions that attribution from the way Nachman addresses him. Keep both judgments.","evidence":[{"reference":"Tosafot on Bava Metzia 57a:2:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Tosafot_on_Bava_Metzia_57a.2.1"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"},{"reference":"Yevamot 121b:16","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Yevamot_121b.16"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"raw":"כסא דחספא","reason":"Heilprin’s source form describes an earthenware cup. The checked Bavli reads a silver cup.","evidence":[{"reference":"Ketubot 85b:4","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ketubot_85b.4"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"raw":"אך רש\"י כתב שזהו שטבע בנהר וצ\"ע","reason":"Rashi’s identity inference from the drowning narrative and Heilprin’s expressed objection remain distinct.","evidence":[{"reference":"Rashi on Ketubot 85b:4:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rashi_on_Ketubot_85b.4.1"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"},{"reference":"Yevamot 121b:16","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Yevamot_121b.16"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"raw":"ומ\"ש היוחסין שהיה בזמן רב לא ידעתי מנ\"ל","reason":"The exact Yuchasin statement assigning Chasa to Rav’s time remains unlocated. Its OCR also gives a separate Rav Chama notice. The Chisda formula in the checked Bavli supplies no direct chronology for Chasa.","evidence":[{"reference":"Niddah 49b:6","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Niddah_49b.6"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Bekhorot 45a:10","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bekhorot_45a.10"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]}],"notes":[{"text":"Retain both remarriage accounts and the cited teacherhood and identity disputes. The received earthenware cup differs from the silver cup in the checked Bavli. The checked Niddah, Bekhorot and Sukkah witnesses read Chisda. Preserve the received Chasa and Heilprin’s proposed repair.","references":[],"urls":[]}],"comparisonEvidence":[{"reference":"Yevamot 121b:16","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Yevamot_121b.16"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Yevamot 121b:17","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Yevamot_121b.17"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Bava Metzia 57a:2","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bava_Metzia_57a.2"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Tosafot on Bava Metzia 57a:2:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Tosafot_on_Bava_Metzia_57a.2.1"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"},{"reference":"Ketubot 85b:4","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ketubot_85b.4"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Rashi on Ketubot 85b:4:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rashi_on_Ketubot_85b.4.1"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"},{"reference":"Niddah 23b:10","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Niddah_23b.10"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Ruth Rabbah 5:4, Wikisource, Chasa","target":{"url":"https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/רות_רבה_ה_ד"},"witness":"Ruth Rabbah, Wikisource digital transcription"},{"reference":"Niddah 49b:6","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Niddah_49b.6"},"witness":"William Davidso